<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 9: </span>Results comparing the best performing models from GBSP, End-to-end LLM, Direct, and Geoparser-augmented approaches. The best scores are bolded.</figcaption>
</figure>
</section>
